%% AltBar — tick-aggregated (no venue publisher; OnBarComplete only). Threshold frozen at session start.
sequenceDiagram
    participant P as RelayIngest.Pump
    participant TR as TickRouter
    participant S as TickAggregationBarSource (e.g. EqD/Renko)
    participant A as IBarAccumulator (frozen threshold)
    participant D as StrategyDispatch
    participant ST as Strategy (IInt64BarStrategy)

    Note over S,A: at session start: ThresholdResolver.ResolveParsed(feedId)<br/>→ frozen threshold → AccumulatorEntry.Open
    loop each TradeTick
        P->>TR: Publish(instrument, tick)
        TR->>S: Feed(in tick)
        S->>A: TryAdvance(TickToSourceRecord.From(tick))
        alt threshold crossed
            A-->>S: emitted bar (+ Renko TryDrainQueued)
            S->>D: onBar(bar,false) → DispatchBar(AltBar-spec)
            D->>ST: OnBarComplete(bar, sub) → submit order
        else still accumulating
            A-->>S: no bar
        end
    end
